<div class="text guide-styles" data-units-dynamic="article" data-zaf-dynamic="article" id="guide-body" lang="en">
<div class="markup-toc-wrapper">
<button class="markup-toc-button">Show Table of Contents</button></div>Welcome to Wowhead's Best in Slot Gear list for Arcane Mage DPS in Cataclysm Classic Phase 4. Gear in this guide is primarily obtained from Dragon Soul, Firelands, Twilight Protocol Dungeons, and Valor Points. This guide will list the recommended gear for your class and role, containing gear sourced from raids, dungeons, PvP, professions, Bind on Equip drops, and reputations.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-in-slot">
<span class="c8">Best in Slot Gear for Arcane Mage DPS in  Phase 4</span></h2>There's some changes to how stats work in cataclysm and a new stat as well, because of this your priorities change a bit as well, but because of reforging it makes it easier to pick and choose how much of each stat you want. You'll want to use a mix of <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71881/brilliant-queens-garnet">
<img alt="Brilliant Queen's Garnet" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_epicgem_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Brilliant Queen's Garnet</span></a> for red socket and items with bad socket bonuses, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71854/artful-lava-coral">
<img alt="Artful Lava Coral" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_epicgem_04.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Artful Lava Coral</span></a> for yellow sockets, and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71864/veiled-shadow-spinel">
<img alt="Veiled Shadow Spinel" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_epicgem_05.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Veiled Shadow Spinel</span></a> on blue sockets to help reach hit cap if there's a need for it.<br/>
<br/>Once you've hit the 17% hit cap, you'll aim for your soft haste cap, this is the amount of haste required to cast <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=30451/arcane-blast">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_arcane_blast.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Arcane Blast</span></a> in 1 sec during the initial burn phase.<br/>This will be between the following values:<ul>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">1623.16 haste Rating as <span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/race_goblin_male.gif");'>Goblin</span>;</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">1767.44 haste Rating as Other Races;</div></li></ul>Remember that haste still has value after these values as these caps are only relevant during <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=2825/bloodlust">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_nature_bloodlust.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bloodlust</span></a> and haste past this number still has benefit throughout the rest of the fight.<br/>
<br/>
