<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="valor-points">Valor Points for Arcane Mage Phase 4</h3>Unlike past phases, we'll no longer be able to buy the normal mode tier tokens through the valor vendor, this means we instead focus on just upgrading the baseline items we have.<br/>
<br/>To be more specific, the cloak listed  is best in slot this phase so prioritize that first and then you can buy the trinket second since it's very good for Spine of Deathwing because its cooldown matches well with the timing of the Tendons.<br/>
<br/>Other than that, the rest are upgrades as well, though not as relevant - and the last 3 items (gloves, head, chest,) are not as important because realistically you'll be using tier items in those slots.<div class="pad"></div>
