<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="rings">Rings for Arcane Mage DPS</h4>There's only two relevant rings for mage this tier within the heroic item level bracket, the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78419/ring-of-the-riven">
<img alt="Ring of the Riven" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_102.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ring of the Riven</span></a> and the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78490/infinite-loop">
<img alt="Infinite Loop" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_88.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Infinite Loop</span></a>, meaning they're both best in slot.<br/>
<br/>Still, it's noteworthy that both the LFR version of <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78427/ring-of-the-riven">
<img alt="Ring of the Riven" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_102.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ring of the Riven</span></a> is available from the new heroic dungeons and replaces tier 12's best in slot <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71449/crystal-prison-band">
<img alt="Crystal Prison Band" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_firelandsraid_03c.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Crystal Prison Band</span></a>.<br/>The same applies to <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77108/seal-of-the-grand-architect">
<img alt="Seal of the Grand Architect" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_90.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Seal of the Grand Architect</span></a> from the <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> vendor to an even greater extent, since it's better than <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71217/infernal-signet-of-the-avengers">
