<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="trinkets">Trinkets for Arcane Mage DPS</h4>In terms of trinkets, this phase is very simple since neither of them changes our gameplay in relation to cooldown usage, instead, they're both passive trinkets; the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77995/will-of-unbinding">
<img alt="Will of Unbinding" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_stonetablet_04.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Will of Unbinding</span></a> raises our intellect and can be looked at as a static 990 intellect item; and the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78000/cunning-of-the-cruel">
<img alt="Cunning of the Cruel" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_coin_09.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cunning of the Cruel</span></a> is essencially a "capacitor"-type trinket (as in it fires off projectiles based on your own casts).<br/>
<br/>The <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77114/bottled-wishes">
<img alt="Bottled Wishes" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_potion_109.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bottled Wishes</span></a> is listed as great, both because it's a solid upgrade vs past options, but also because its cooldown matches very well with the cooldown window between tendons in the spine of deathwing boss where arcane mage will be the meta for progress.<br/>
<br/>The LFR versions of the two best in slot trinkets are also relevant to mention because they both replace last phases' best in slot trinkets (with the exception of <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60233/shard-of-woe">
<img alt="Shard of Woe" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_frost_iceshard.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Shard of Woe</span></a> on really long fights performing better than ilvl 384 <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77980/cunning-of-the-cruel">
<img alt="Cunning of the Cruel" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_coin_09.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cunning of the Cruel</span></a>).<div class="pad"></div>
